; GFOS's repo list, read by C:apt (docs/design/GFOPENAPT.md). It is S:apt.sources, and yours to change.
;   github <owner>/<repo> <tag>   a release whose files include GFOpenUpdate.index
;   github <owner>/<repo>         a repository's newest release, the same file on it
;   index <address>               an index anywhere: GFOpenUpdate's form, or the software store's
;   off <any of those>            listed, not read
; "apt update" reads them; "apt sources" shows how each went.
; Copyright (c) 2026 AmiCradle Team. MIT licence.

; GFOpenUp's own parts: the index GFOpenUpdate reads
github DalsinAI/gfopenup updates

; The GFOS software store's catalogue (amigagfosports/gfosdistribution)
index https://raw.githubusercontent.com/amigagfosports/gfosdistribution/main/software/index.txt

; The parts that have releases of their own (gfopenup's parts.lock). Each is off until its releases carry
; GFOpenUpdate.index and the part's archive beside it; until then the part comes in GFOpenUp's index above.
off github DalsinAI/acgame
off github DalsinAI/gfopensynth
off github DalsinAI/gfopenallegro

; Our applications that have releases of their own (gfopenup's apps.lock). Off for the same reason.
off github DalsinAI/gfopenbrowser
off github DalsinAI/gfoffice
off github DalsinAI/GFOpenMakerSuite
off github DalsinAI/gfopendraw
off github DalsinAI/gfopenasm
off github DalsinAI/amigaclisp
off github DalsinAI/gfamigaamule
off github DalsinAI/gfamigafilezilla
off github DalsinAI/gfamiga4pane
off github DalsinAI/gfamigacodeblocks
off github DalsinAI/gfamigafreefilesync
off github DalsinAI/gfamigawxmaxima
off github DalsinAI/gfamigardp
off github DalsinAI/gfamigaaudacity
off github DalsinAI/gfamigawxhexeditor
off github DalsinAI/gfamigagolly
off github DalsinAI/gfamigaopencpn
off github DalsinAI/gfamigakicad
off github DalsinAI/amigadosbox
